# Local design-tooling installs (`npx impeccable install`). These carry a
# platform-specific engine binary (~14 MB, windows-x64) that has no business in
# a public repo and would bloat every clone. The skills are reproducible from the
# package; the .impeccable/ context files that carry the actual design decisions
# are committed.
